@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor White
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor White

participant "API Provider\n(NEFSim | CAMARA Gateway)" as PROV
participant "OpenCAPIF\nCCF" as CCF

rnote over PROV : 1. Export the OpenAPI specification and translate\nit into a ServiceAPIDescription (securityMethods = OAUTH)
PROV -> CCF : 2. POST /published-apis/v1/{apfId}/service-apis\n[mTLS (APF-1 certificate),\nServiceAPIDescription (apiName, aefProfiles (aefId,\nversions (resources), interfaceDescriptions))]
alt service API published
  CCF --> PROV : 3.a. 201 Created [ServiceAPIDescription (apiId)]
  rnote over PROV : 4. Store apiId of the published service API
else service API with the same apiName already published
  CCF --> PROV : 3.b. 403 Forbidden [Already registered service with same api name]
  rnote over PROV : 4. Keep the existing publication
end

@enduml
